contentText:
This is partner content.

Weekend one of Coachella 2026 was full of iconic performances from Sabrina Carpenter, Justin Bieber, Karol G, Kehlani, KATSEYE and so many more! We take you through everything you missed from interviews with BINI & KATSEYE to Don Toliver’s set and more!

KATSEYE:

Bonkers. It was bonkers.&nbsp;

Kaskade:

Justin did amazing last night. I mean, I was just like everyone was crying, 100,000 people were crying. Like my childhood.&nbsp;

Tetris Kelly:

Birthday week. How you feeling girl?&nbsp;

Sexyy Red:

I&#8217;m feeling good.&nbsp;

We spent three days in the desert for Coachella and from interviewing some of the artists performing and Lizzo here to support you, though you can&#8217;t be nervous. Are you ready for her to come on stage with you?&nbsp;

Yeah.&nbsp;

To attending some of the best parties, we take you there in Billboard All Access presented by Amazon. Day one of Coachella, we kicked it off with the 818 Outpost, where Kaytranada brought out Justine Skye and special guest Lizzo came for the vibe. We then hit the festival for a surprise Joe Jonas appearance at the Aperol activation.&nbsp; And caught up with BINI after their set. I mean, literally, guys, I love that. It was also historic as well. You know, the first Filipino girl group to do that. How was that history making moment? I love seeing your emotion on stage.

BINI:

We are so happy. We&#8217;re grateful for that historical moment. It&#8217;s not always that we get to be on the Coachella stage.

And you know, we had to see KATSEYE&#8217;s Coachella debut who&nbsp; brought HUNTR/X to the desert for a &#8220;Golden&#8221; moment. We walked our girl, Sexyy Red to her set. We got an Aries Queen on the way to her Coachella set, birthday week. How you feeling girl?&nbsp;

Keep watching for more!
